4896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5267552,"review":"Amazing stay!","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5277525,"review":"The apartment was clean and looks exactly like the pictures. Would definitely stay there again.","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5278780,"review":"Neat and clean with a great location","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5304152,"review":"Thanks for being responsive!","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5314129,"review":"Veryy amazing and clean place","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5326263,"review":"Had a pleasant stay at this studio. It looks exactly as shown in the pictures, which we appreciated. The host was very responsive and eager to follow up when we had some feedback. Thank you!","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z"},{"id":5330829,"review":"L'appartement est superbe, très propre, bien équipé, avec un magnifique rooftop et un emplacement pratique proche de l'aéroport. Cependant, l'adresse indiquée sur Airbnb était incorrecte, nous avons donc été conduits à un endroit difficile d'accès à 35 minutes de la vraie adresse, ce qui a ajouté 35 minutes supplémentaires au trajet déjà long depuis Sharm el Sheikh. De plus, malgré un accord pour un check-out à 13h, nous avons été dérangés à 12h pour le départ. À part ces désagréments, l'appartement est excellent.","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z"},{"id":5353538,"review":"Really enjoyed staying here, the space was lovely and cosy. Everything was provided even items to use in the kitchen. Best part is you have a lot of privacy and a large private balcony. Safe and secure and access anytime you need. \n\nThank you I really enjoyed my stay ❤️❤️","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5369832,"review":"The studio was perfect, just like the pictures and in a convenient location from the airport. Xuru Stays was amazing - we had stayed at one of their other properties before and had such a good experience we wanted to book with them again! They are always responsive and give very clear instructions. We would definitely come here again!","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z"},{"id":5393868,"review":"perfect","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z"},{"id":5396818,"review":"Positive:\nFriendly and quick Respone stuff, furniture  and decoration is just perfect. Very quit and friendly neighborhood\n\nNegative:\nNothing","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z"},{"id":5398124,"review":"Very good experience.","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z"},{"id":5411383,"review":"We really enjoyed our stay, the apartment looked exactly like the pictures. Xuru stays team was very responsive, friendly and provided everything that we needed.\nThe area is near lots of restaurants, markets and in a private calm place.\nWould definitely want to revisit again. :)","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5418109,"review":"Positive:\nنظيف والجلسه الخارجيه\n\nNegative:\nلا يوجد","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5419546,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nThe property is hard to get in there are 3 doors that need to be opened. The bed was not clean but they did bring clean crew to fix it.","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5494919,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\n1: The place asks you to pay the full amount in advance without a refund even if you find problems and do not like the place.\n2: The place asks you for an undisclosed security deposit when booking and does not return the same amount to you but rather calculates it in the local currency claiming that he cannot return the same amount to your account because he has a problem in order to defraud customers with additional amounts. \n3: The place does not contain any kind of insulation from street noise. \n4: Poor cleaning level .","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z"},{"id":5529424,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5564414,"review":"Great place","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5594984,"review":"السكن كما في الصور ممتاز ومريح\nالمشكلة المكان في النظافة ..!!؟؟","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5644368,"review":"⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Absolutely Perfect Stay in New Cairo!\n\nI had an amazing experience staying at this Airbnb! The highlight was definitely the beautiful patio — spacious, private, and perfect for relaxing in the evening with a coffee or enjoying breakfast in the morning sun. The space was spotless, well-furnished, and had everything I needed for a comfortable and peaceful stay. The host was incredibly responsive and made sure I felt at home from check-in to check-out. The location in New Cairo is also ideal — quiet, secure, and close to great cafes and shops. I’d definitely stay here again and recommend it to anyone looking for a relaxing getaway in the city!","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5666543,"review":"My forever fav host \nCleanest \nCoziest \nEver","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z"},{"id":5669355,"review":"Clean, cool & hep place to stay, the roof top is very nice, host was supportive id recommend this stay.","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5670739,"review":"مكان جميل جدا و متعاونين","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5714625,"review":"Great as always","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5740461,"review":"Navštívila jsem již mnoho míst v Káhiře, kde jsem bydlela. Tohle patřilo mezi moje oblíbené.","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5769735,"review":"Professional team, clean and comfortable place.","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z"},{"id":5788633,"review":"Alles super 👍","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5799379,"review":"🩵🩵🩵","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5808344,"review":"Love it as always","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z"},{"id":5822397,"review":"I enjoyed my stay. Exactly as prescribed. \nExcellent location. Friendly and responsive host.","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5832663,"review":"Lovely as always can’t wait to go to more of there houses around the country","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5854607,"review":"Very helpful and responsive when I needed an early check-in.","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5862269,"review":"I had a wonderful stay! Very cozy and comfortable with a lot of privacy. The team was very responsive and helpful. I will definitely be coming back again!","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5892063,"review":"رائع","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5897997,"review":"Incredible host, very quick to respond and help. Recommend 100%","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5900934,"review":"احببت المسكن فهوا جميل جداً ومطابق للصور وفي منطقة هادئة وجميله تعطي شعور بالراحه والدفى كانك في منزلك، أعجبني كل شي من ديكور ومساحات وخصوصية وتوفير كل الأساسيات المهمه، ولكن لدي ملاحظات بسيطه لتنبيه المضيف على فريق النظافه يبدو انه لا ينجز عمله بدقه واتقان بحيث ان الأسطح والأرضيات لم يتم مسحها جيداً من الغبار، وبالنسبه لمفرش السرير وهذا اكثر امر ضايقني يظهر وبوضوح انها مستهلك وفيه بقع واضحه، يوجد نفس الأمر أيضاً على الكنبه في الصاله؛ والأمر الاخر يفضل أن يكون هناك رقم تواصل مباشر مع المستضيف للرد السرع في حال واجه المستأجر صعوبه في الوصول او الدخول بالرمز السري او اي مشكله، فهذا يسهل العمليه اكثر من التواصل عن طريق دردشة التطبيق؛ واخر امر هوا عدم وجود اضاءه في درج العماره كامل مما يضطر لاستخدام كشاف الجوال في كل مره عند الخروج والدخول ليلاً؛ وملاحظه اخيره احدى روابط الموقع المسجله لديكم غير صحيحه فهي تودي إلى موقع آخر باسم مشابه ولكن بعيد جداً ف الرجاء تحديثها للمستقبل.\nشكراً لاستضافتكم وارجوا الحرص على التحسين فمسكنكم جميل جداً يحتاج لإضافة مجهود بسيط فقط ليكتمل، سأكرر التجربه باذن ا","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5909242,"review":"طاقم العمل محترم جدآ وسريع لما احتجت حاجه في النظافه بليل في الشقه كانت الساعه ١ صباحا استجابو بسرعه و جم و المكان حلو و مناسب لاكن لو انتا عايز تروح وسط البلد كتير و تتردد علي هناك كتير المكان هيبقي بعيد عليك و هتدفع فلوس كتير في أوبر حتي لو معاك عربيه هتدفع فلوس كتير بنزين أنا دفعت حوالي 100€في الأسبوع في أوبر لاكن لو هتبقي في التجمع اغلب الوقت فا هو مكان مناسب مع طاقم عمل مميز و محترم ❤️","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z"},{"id":6114145,"review":"Really enjoyed my stay. The cosy apartment and private terrace were fantastic. The bed was extremely comfortable. The smart TV and enclosed shower were a nice bonus. The host was always responsive and helpful.\n\nThe only things to note are that the apartment is on the second floor with no elevator, there are no supermarkets within walking distance, and having a washing machine would make longer stays even more convenient.\n\nOverall, I thoroughly enjoyed my stay and would highly recommend this place. Thank you, Xuru Team, for hosting me.","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6157208,"review":"Great stay","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6172675,"review":"Place is peaceful, quite and great.... Only the curtain wanst block the sunlight totally while sleeping","rental_id":204896,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}